# Auto-created as .envrcs/.envrc.secrets by the root .envrc and never
# overwritten afterwards; this copy is yours to edit. Paths are relative to
# .envrcs/. .envrc.sops is copied unchanged from xorq-labs/xorq-envrcs, whose
# .envrcs/README.md ("sops") is the reference for the helpers.
source_env .envrc.sops

# TABPFN_TOKEN: your Prior Labs API token. tabpfn-client reads this name
# itself, inside fit and predict (never at import, never into a build). A
# sops-encrypted dotenv holding TABPFN_TOKEN=..., encrypted to your own key; .gitignore keeps
# .envrcs/*.sops-encrypted out of commits because it is one person's token.
use sops_if_exists .env.priorlabs.sops-encrypted
